/mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIyOTU3MjU4OA==&amp;mid=2247518773&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2913116eadc171802e0be6d96ecbcb40&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIyOTU3MjU4OA==&amp;mid=2247518773&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2913116eadc171802e0be6d96ecbcb40&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\"><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/zJs4icu9sw398b6L8ibUEOLAapvE4s6NtyJWgDJqZr4uSrGn397wiapHK0MEqFZmNugqdjiaMZfPQFmicVJZc9bGZQg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></a><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIyOTU3MjU4OA==&amp;mid=2247518063&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2b9db07b6a6c29769b9c4a7e9e6cabb0&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIyOTU3MjU4OA==&amp;mid=2247518063&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2b9db07b6a6c29769b9c4a7e9e6cabb0&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\"><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/zJs4icu9sw398b6L8ibUEOLAapvE4s6NtyjoKxv7SGibVGcKP7jy77scPLKbUwAicUWWuXe4VRr60XEwEXib1pdwsqg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></a></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"cf3b3d5acb9d87ebf3f07afc07635cfa992666fdc3ab47068373de41841ef960","textLength":1715,"sourceSha256":"9d6f0c6083e1dbf1ecc000269da59c88a0c94d69f940b451d198cd8b4feb459c","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-f3422ae6f5a3c5a24d65","title":"2025年南方科技大学海洋科学与工程系接收2026级推荐免试研究生（含直博生） 预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:13.095148+00:00"}
